Absolutely go back and do Sokoban. This is actually the first thing I
usually do in a game. Use the walkthroughs on the nethack wiki to
complete it without and problems and get yourself and extremely useful
BoH or Reflection without much trouble. Either one would help you out
a lot.

Have you considered dipping for Excalibur? I prefer it to Snickersnee.

Maybe write an enchant armor scroll and read it while confused with
only your gauntlets on to get them repaired and rustproof.

After Sokoban, level-grind until XLvl 14 and do the quest. It's very
easy, though it's best to have a way to deal with the nemesis quickly
to avoid the small chance of getting bisected... Wand of sleep? (Check
on the wiki if he's resistant, I'm not sure)

Good luck. My first ascension was with an archeologist and I
thoroughly enjoyed it. I'd suggest spending your first wish on a
blessed +2 fixed Grayswandir, then get your pet to kill the watch
captain in Minetown for a silver sabre to two-weapon with. You cut
through everything in one or two hits, it's a little silly.


